			(property
				(name "Substitution basis")
				(value "Apple's 2.4 GHz antenna is an inverted-F PRINTED ON THE PLASTIC CARRIER, and its geometry is CANNOT DETERMINE. A chip antenna is CHOSEN because it works on a board of any outline and needs no carrier: this board is meant to be switched on, not to be the right shape. THE MPN CARRIES ITS 'E': the catalogue has no part called 2450AT18A100, and x_lcsc_resolve matched that shorter string inside the longer 2450AT18A100E and returned a code for a part number this sheet did not name. Both ends were wrong and both are fixed - the matcher is token-exact, and this line now names what can actually be bought.")
